  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:04.750" end="00:12.750" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Oh, oh, oh, oh, oh, oh)</p>
      <p begin="00:19.360" end="00:23.320" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Like a telescope, we looking at the stars)</p>
      <p begin="00:23.320" end="00:27.090" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(She's so damn fine, and I'm so high, who you are?)</p>
      <p begin="00:27.090" end="00:32.030" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(She's so damn bad, I done her bought Audemars, oh)</p>
      <p begin="00:32.030" end="00:33.530" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Uml, what the fuck?)</p>
      <p begin="00:33.250" end="00:35.340" ttm:agent="v1">The bigger the bag, the better the bitches</p>
      <p begin="00:35.340" end="00:37.090" ttm:agent="v1">I know they cooking, we put down the switches</p>
      <p begin="00:37.090" end="00:38.840" ttm:agent="v1">I bought new wood, she been smoking on Swishers</p>
      <p begin="00:38.840" end="00:40.720" ttm:agent="v1">The switches been running, the opps been pissing</p>
      <p begin="00:40.720" end="00:42.640" ttm:agent="v1">Fuck on a ho, do you get hurt to do dishes?</p>
      <p begin="00:42.640" end="00:44.510" ttm:agent="v1">I won't be smiling, I don't do pictures</p>
      <p begin="00:44.510" end="00:46.290" ttm:agent="v1">I don't do hers, I don't do kisses</p>
      <p begin="00:46.290" end="00:49.370" ttm:agent="v1">Fuck no ho, I don't want no kids</p>
      <p begin="00:49.370" end="00:53.220" ttm:agent="v1">Like a telescope, we looking at the stars</p>
      <p begin="00:53.220" end="00:56.740" ttm:agent="v1">She's so damn fine, and I'm so high, who you are?</p>
      <p begin="00:56.740" end="01:02.630" ttm:agent="v1">She's so damn bad, I done her bought her Audemars, oh</p>
      <p begin="01:02.630" end="01:04.810" ttm:agent="v1">If it's double the money, it's double the size</p>
      <p begin="01:04.810" end="01:06.600" ttm:agent="v1">Facts for them bitches that fuck for the night</p>
      <p begin="01:06.600" end="01:08.320" ttm:agent="v1">Double O Cactus just ain't call us a night</p>
      <p begin="01:08.320" end="01:10.530" ttm:agent="v1">She told me she fuck me, no matter the size</p>
      <p begin="01:10.530" end="01:14.270" ttm:agent="v1">Giving up keys, we giving up, please</p>
      <p begin="01:14.270" end="01:16.050" ttm:agent="v1">Sip my drink</p>
      <p begin="01:16.050" end="01:17.720" ttm:agent="v1">Boy, I got your bitch all on her knees</p>
      <p begin="01:17.720" end="01:19.220" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Ah, yeah, schyeah)</p>
      <p begin="01:18.630" end="01:22.690" ttm:agent="v1">They know I'm a big boss, got a big boss in this bitch</p>
      <p begin="01:22.690" end="01:26.090" ttm:agent="v1">They know I'm a big talker, hide my big body and they see it</p>
      <p begin="01:26.090" end="01:29.310" ttm:agent="v1">No one taught me bitch, RIP, the bitch may die</p>
      <p begin="01:29.310" end="01:31.240" ttm:agent="v1">Turn the light, on I'm outside</p>
      <p begin="01:31.240" end="01:33.260" ttm:agent="v1">Bitch, are the lights off? Or you inside?</p>
      <p begin="01:33.260" end="01:34.860" ttm:agent="v1">Been taking these drugs for fun</p>
      <p begin="01:34.860" end="01:37.290" ttm:agent="v1">Bitch been put it in the ass all the time</p>
      <p begin="01:37.290" end="01:38.820" ttm:agent="v1">Bitch been taking the rum, bitch</p>
      <p begin="01:38.820" end="01:41.090" ttm:agent="v1">I'm bringin' my motherfuckin' gun</p>
      <p begin="01:41.090" end="01:43.080" ttm:agent="v1">If your lights are off, I'm outside</p>
      <p begin="01:43.080" end="01:44.860" ttm:agent="v1">If your lights are off, I'm outside</p>
      <p begin="01:44.860" end="01:48.230" ttm:agent="v1">Had the lights off, I'm outside</p>
      <p begin="01:48.230" end="01:49.730" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Oh, oh, oh)</p>
      <p begin="01:49.530" end="01:52.040" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Like a telescope, we looking at the stars)</p>
      <p begin="01:52.040" end="01:56.370" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(She's so damn fine, and I'm so high, who you are?)</p>
      <p begin="01:56.370" end="02:04.370" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(She's so damn bad, I done her bought out of Mars, oh)</p>
      <p begin="02:08.360" end="02:12.900" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Uml, what the fuck?)</p>
